WEBVTT

NOTE RJ Tech English captions derived from the original bilingual track.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Let’s begin.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.200
Tools: a powered driver and T30 Torx socket.

3
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:16.400
Also prepare a torque wrench and thread-locking compound.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:26.955
First, remove the fasteners from the original underbody protection plates.

5
00:00:34.152 --> 00:00:43.152
Fit the new protection plates with the longer section facing the front of the vehicle.

6
00:00:43.252 --> 00:00:54.952
Replace the screws with M6 × 30 T30 Torx pan-head screws.

7
00:00:55.053 --> 00:01:02.553
Install the spacer between the center plate and the frame.

8
00:01:02.553 --> 00:01:09.318
Apply thread-locking compound to every specified fastener thread.

9
00:01:22.084 --> 00:01:29.584
Apply threadlocker to every specified fastener.

10
00:02:12.372 --> 00:02:15.198
Snug the fasteners with the powered tool.

11
00:02:20.992 --> 00:02:28.792
Finish with a torque wrench at 12 N·m.
